==Battleground==
*1 [[Gory Dark]] spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*1 [[Doge Dark]] spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*1 [[Doge Dark]] spawns after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*1 [[Doge Dark]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Doge Dark]] spawns after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>.
*1 [[Doge Dark]] spawns after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[The Rose Garden Witch]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 20~30 seconds<sup>600f~900f</sup>.
**10 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
**5 [[Gory Dark]]s spawn, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
**3 [[Shadow Boxer K]]s spawn, delay 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.

