==Trivia==
*This stage is named after [[Mami Tomoe (Uber Rare Cat)|Mami Tomoe]]'s signature finishing move.
**"Tiro finale" is Italian for "final shot", though the correct name of the move should have been "sparo finale", as "tiro" is only used for bows, crossbows and non-firearms in general.

